<!DOCTYPE html>
<html class="light" lang="en">
  <head>
    <%- include('../../partials/head') %>
  </head>
  <body class="min-h-screen bg-surface-bright text-on-surface hf-dashboard">
    <% const rentDetailsUser = typeof currentUser === 'object' && currentUser ? currentUser : {}; %>
    <% const displayName = rentDetailsUser.fullName || 'Landlord'; %>
    <%- include('../../partials/sidebar-landlord') %>

    <header class="sticky top-0 z-40 flex min-h-16 items-center justify-between border-b border-outline-variant bg-surface px-4 shadow-sm md:pl-[264px] md:pr-8">
      <div class="min-w-0"><p class="truncate text-label-sm font-bold text-secondary">Landlord workspace</p><p class="truncate text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant"><%= displayName %></p></div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1 sm:gap-2">
        <a class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/user/landlord/notification-bell" aria-label="Notifications" title="Notifications"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">notifications</span></a>
        <a class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/user/landlord/messages" aria-label="Messages" title="Messages"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">chat_bubble</span></a>
        <a class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/user/landlord/settings" aria-label="Settings" title="Settings"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">settings</span></a>
        <a class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/user/landlord/user-profile" aria-label="Landlord profile" title="Landlord profile"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">person</span></a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="w-full px-4 py-6 md:ml-[240px] md:w-[calc(100%-240px)] md:px-8 md:py-8 hf-dashboard-main">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
        <div class="mb-8">
          <a class="mb-4 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 font-bold text-primary hover:underline" href="/user/landlord/properties"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl" aria-hidden="true">arrow_back</span>Back to Properties</a>
          <p class="mb-1 text-label-md font-bold text-secondary">Property setup</p>
          <h1 class="text-headline-lg font-bold text-primary">Rent and availability</h1>
          <p class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Pricing and tenancy terms require a saved property draft, clear total costs, and an authoritative availability lifecycle.</p>
        </div>

        <section class="mb-8 border-y border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-low px-5 py-6 sm:px-6" aria-labelledby="rent-step-status-title">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary text-on-primary" aria-hidden="true">payments</span>
              <div><p class="text-label-sm font-bold uppercase text-secondary">Step status</p><h2 id="rent-step-status-title" class="mt-1 text-headline-md font-bold text-primary">Rent and availability cannot be saved</h2><p class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">There is no draft ID, currency or rent-period schema, jurisdiction policy, availability record, cost calculation, validation endpoint, or revision history.</p></div>
            </div>
            <span class="inline-flex min-h-11 shrink-0 items-center rounded-full bg-surface-container-high px-4 text-label-sm font-bold text-on-surface-variant">Step 3 unavailable</span>
          </div>
        </section>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 xl:grid-cols-12">
          <div class="space-y-8 xl:col-span-8">
            <section class="border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest px-6 py-10 text-center sm:px-8" aria-labelledby="rent-step-title">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-5xl text-primary" aria-hidden="true">money_off</span>
              <p class="mt-4 text-label-sm font-bold uppercase text-secondary">Planned step 3 of 5</p>
              <h2 id="rent-step-title" class="mt-2 text-headline-md font-bold text-on-surface">Financial and tenancy fields are unavailable</h2>
              <p class="mx-auto mt-2 max-w-2xl text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Do not enter rent, deposits, bill amounts, dates, tenancy lengths, viewing rules, or applicant criteria until the application can validate and save them without ambiguity.</p>
              <a class="mt-6 inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-primary px-5 font-bold text-on-primary hover:opacity-90" href="/user/landlord/properties/add/address"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl" aria-hidden="true">first_page</span>Open setup start</a>
            </section>

            <section aria-labelledby="rent-foundations-title">
              <div class="mb-4"><h2 id="rent-foundations-title" class="text-headline-md font-bold text-on-surface">Required rent and availability foundations</h2><p class="mt-1 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Renters need complete, current, and jurisdiction-aware terms before applying.</p></div>
              <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
                <article class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary" aria-hidden="true">currency_exchange</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-bold text-on-surface">Unambiguous money values</h3><p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Store currency, amount in minor units, payment period, deposits, refundable status, included bills, exclusions, and calculated upfront cost.</p></article>
                <article class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary" aria-hidden="true">gavel</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-bold text-on-surface">Jurisdiction-aware terms</h3><p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Validate deposits, fees, notices, tenancy lengths, licensing, and required disclosures against the property's legal jurisdiction.</p></article>
                <article class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary" aria-hidden="true">event_available</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-bold text-on-surface">Authoritative availability</h3><p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Track available-from date, occupancy, tenancy dependencies, viewing readiness, timezone, status changes, expiry, and conflict history.</p></article>
                <article class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary" aria-hidden="true">balance</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-bold text-on-surface">Fair application criteria</h3><p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Criteria must be relevant, consistently applied, explainable, and must not rank or exclude people using protected characteristics.</p></article>
              </div>
            </section>

            <section aria-labelledby="planned-rent-fields-title">
              <div class="mb-4"><h2 id="planned-rent-fields-title" class="text-headline-md font-bold text-on-surface">Planned term groups</h2><p class="mt-1 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">These groups remain unavailable until a draft service can validate them together.</p></div>
              <dl class="divide-y divide-outline-variant rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest text-body-sm">
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 p-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"><dt class="font-bold text-on-surface">Rent, deposit, and total upfront cost</dt><dd class="text-on-surface-variant">Unavailable</dd></div>
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 p-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"><dt class="font-bold text-on-surface">Available date and tenancy length</dt><dd class="text-on-surface-variant">Unavailable</dd></div>
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 p-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"><dt class="font-bold text-on-surface">Included bills and excluded costs</dt><dd class="text-on-surface-variant">Unavailable</dd></div>
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 p-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"><dt class="font-bold text-on-surface">Viewing and application criteria</dt><dd class="text-on-surface-variant">Unavailable</dd></div>
              </dl>
            </section>
          </div>

          <aside class="space-y-6 xl:col-span-4" aria-label="Rent and availability boundaries">
            <section class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-6" aria-labelledby="rent-actions-title">
              <h2 id="rent-actions-title" class="text-headline-md font-bold text-primary">Action availability</h2>
              <dl class="mt-4 divide-y divide-outline-variant text-body-sm">
                <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-3"><dt class="text-on-surface-variant">Enter financial terms</dt><dd class="font-bold text-on-surface">Unavailable</dd></div>
                <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-3"><dt class="text-on-surface-variant">Set availability</dt><dd class="font-bold text-on-surface">Unavailable</dd></div>
                <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-3"><dt class="text-on-surface-variant">Save draft</dt><dd class="font-bold text-on-surface">Unavailable</dd></div>
                <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-3"><dt class="text-on-surface-variant">Continue to media</dt><dd class="font-bold text-on-surface">Unavailable</dd></div>
              </dl>
            </section>

            <section class="rounded-lg border border-error bg-error-container p-6" aria-labelledby="financial-data-title"><h2 id="financial-data-title" class="text-headline-md font-bold text-on-error-container">Do not send financial data</h2><p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-error-container">Do not send bank details, card information, deposit payments, applicant income files, or transaction evidence through Contact or Messages.</p></section>

            <section class="border-l-4 border-primary bg-surface-container-low px-5 py-4" aria-labelledby="availability-meaning-title"><h2 id="availability-meaning-title" class="font-bold text-on-surface">Availability must be explicit</h2><p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">A blank date or draft listing does not mean a home is available. Published availability needs a saved source, owner, timestamp, and update path.</p></section>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>

    <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
